<title>USA: Union Pacific Resources sets $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Resources sets $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Union Pacific Resources Group Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Smith Barney.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNION PACIFIC RESOURCES GROUP INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.50 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2096</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.718  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.521	 PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +84 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING U.S. TREASURY 6.00 PERCENT BOND DUE 02/2026</p>
